### Phase 5 - reports, auto-hide, admin moderation, audit log
@host = http://localhost:8080
@user1 = paste-user1-token
@user2 = paste-user2-token
@user3 = paste-user3-token
@moderator = paste-moderator-token
@superAdmin = paste-super-admin-token
@postId = 1
@reportId = 1

### ---------- admin login ----------
POST {{host}}/api/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "your_admin_username",
  "password": "your_admin_password"
}

### ---------- user reports ----------

### 1. Report someone else's approved post in your college -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/report
Authorization: Bearer {{user1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "SCAM",
  "comment": "This asks for payment outside the platform."
}

### 2. Report the same post again -> 409
POST {{host}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/report
Authorization: Bearer {{user1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "SPAM",
  "comment": "Duplicate."
}

### 3. Report your own post -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/report
Authorization: Bearer {{user1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "OTHER",
  "comment": "Self report."
}
###    (Use a post id owned by user1.)

### 4. Report a post from another college or not APPROVED -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/posts/999999/report
Authorization: Bearer {{user1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "OTHER",
  "comment": "Not visible."
}

### 5. Comment longer than 500 chars -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/report
Authorization: Bearer {{user2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "SPAM",
  "comment": ""
}

### 6. Second and third distinct users report the same post -> 201, then 201
###    After the third open report the post is HIDDEN with hiddenReason REPORTS.
POST {{host}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/report
Authorization: Bearer {{user2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "INAPPROPRIATE", "comment": "Inappropriate photos."}

POST {{host}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/report
Authorization: Bearer {{user3}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "PROHIBITED_ITEM", "comment": "This is a restricted item."}

### 7. It disappears from the feed and from other users' detail -> 200 but no post
GET {{host}}/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{user2}}

GET {{host}}/api/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user2}}
###    Expected: 404

### 8. The owner still sees it as HIDDEN in /mine -> 200, status HIDDEN
GET {{host}}/api/posts/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{user1}}

### ---------- admin reports ----------

### 9. List open reports (oldest first) -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/admin/reports?status=OPEN&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}

### 10. Dismiss one report while others remain -> 200, post stays HIDDEN
PATCH {{host}}/api/admin/reports/{{reportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"action": "DISMISS", "note": "Not a scam, just a rude reply."}

### 11. Dismiss the remaining reports -> the post returns to APPROVED
PATCH {{host}}/api/admin/reports/{{reportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"action": "DISMISS", "note": "Last open report."}

GET {{host}}/api/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user2}}
###    Expected: 200 again

### 12. Resolve without deleting -> only that report changes
PATCH {{host}}/api/admin/reports/{{reportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"action": "RESOLVE", "note": "Handled by warning the seller."}

### 13. Resolve with deletePost -> post DELETED, all open reports resolved
PATCH {{host}}/api/admin/reports/{{reportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"action": "RESOLVE", "deletePost": true, "note": "Prohibited item confirmed."}

### 14. Acting on an already resolved report -> 400
PATCH {{host}}/api/admin/reports/{{reportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"action": "DISMISS", "note": "Too late."}

### ---------- admin posts ----------

### 15. List all posts, all colleges, with filters -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/admin/posts?status=HIDDEN&q=lamp&collegeId=1&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}

### 16. Full detail with images, aiReviewResult and reports -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/admin/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}

### 17. Delete with no reason -> 400
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": ""}

### 18. Delete with reason -> 200
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "Prohibited item confirmed by photo."}

### 19. Delete again -> 400
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "Again."}

### ---------- audit log ----------

### 20. Super admin -> 200, newest first
### Response items: id (String), actorType (ADMIN|SYSTEM), actorId, actorName,
### action, targetType, targetId, reason, metadata, createdAt.
GET {{host}}/api/admin/audit-log?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdmin}}

### 21. Filter by target and actor -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/admin/audit-log?targetType=POST&targetId={{postId}}&actorId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdmin}}

### 21b. Filter by action and time window (ISO instants) -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/admin/audit-log?action=DELETE_POST&from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdmin}}

### 22. Moderator -> 403
GET {{host}}/api/admin/audit-log
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}

### 23. User token on admin route -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/admin/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{user1}}